,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">SAP拟裁员至少1万人以推进AI优先战略，重点波及产品工程与销售部门</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI发布预印本证明矩阵乘法最优算法指数ω恰为9/4</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI修复GPT-6.2计费错误，Astra与Sol模型额度消耗分别增加40%与25%</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">跟 AI 聊一句花多少钱？DeepSeek 灰度测试“消耗额度”，把账单摊在你面前</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/dbd8258dd3c8d4d98c4d605ceca02ad6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">跟 AI 聊一句花多少钱。DeepSeek 灰度测试“消耗额度”，把账单摊在你面前AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Nov 27, 202670免费的 AI 聊天，背后每句话都在烧钱——DeepSeek 决定把这本账摊开。11 月 26 日起，部分用户反馈其网页端和 App 正在灰度测试“显示本轮消耗额度”功能：完成一轮对话后，界面弹出详情页，展示本次交互消耗的 Token 数与估算金额，价格与 API 持平。个人对话依然免费，但单次对话的计算成本从此可见。一毛钱的账，拆成三笔 从用户截图看，额度按“空闲时段”价格估算，计费拆成三个维度：输入缓存命中部分单价 0.02 元 / 百万 tokens，本轮用量约 18.5 万，折合 0.0037 元。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布Hy3D 3.6模型，实现原生3D生成并接入工业生产管线</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d99fb89f856083f6a809190c773c3db.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月27日，腾讯混元正式发布新一代原生3D生成模型Hy3D 3.6。该模型通过底层架构重构，解决了传统AI生成模型网格拓扑混乱、UV不可用及材质缺乏物理真实感等痛点，使生成的3D资产具备“即插即用”的工业级品质。技术上，Hy3D 3.6采用VAE+DiT架构，直接学习3D资产的几何与纹理分布，并结合SFT与DPO偏好对齐优化，支持生成高质量PBR材质贴图，适用于角色、生物及复杂道具创作。目前，该模型已通过腾讯云Token Hub提供API服务，并深度接入腾讯AI创意智能体Miora、游戏资产生成平台LAP及影视AI平台WorkRally。Hy3D 3.6的发布标志着AI 3D生成从“2D拼凑”转向“原生3D学习”，旨在打通从AI生成到Maya、Blender及Unreal Engine等专业生产工作流的最后一</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SAP拟裁员至少1万人以推进AI优先战略，重点波及产品工程与销售部门</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/273d5f15835d88f2e3c6d7dee4134883.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">欧洲软件巨头SAP正制定新一轮重组计划，拟削减至少1万个岗位，约占其全球员工总数的9%。此次裁员重点聚焦产品与工程及销售部门，旨在全面转向“AI优先”战略，将AI工具深度嵌入企业应用软件。尽管SAP今年三季度总营收同比增长13%至102.7亿欧元，云业务收入大增26%，但公司仍决定通过组织架构调整优化资源配置。这是SAP三年内第二次启动万人级重组，此前2024年1月已进行过同等规模的裁员。CFO Dominik Asam此前暗示员工人数增长趋势需逆转。目前SAP官方未直接置评，仅表示将持续审视组织架构以确保与战略及客户需求一致。此次人事变动伴随着执行董事会的密集换血，预计具体方案将在明年1月的业绩发布会上进一步明确。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI发布预印本证明矩阵乘法最优算法指数ω恰为9/4</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f39d013c609928964b3655cf21265248.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于11月24日发布预印本，正式宣布证明矩阵乘法指数ω恰好等于9/4。该证明通过合并今年10月得出的ω≤9/4结论与此次证实的ω≥9/4，实现了上下界的闭合。矩阵乘法指数ω刻画了当矩阵规模n趋于无穷大时，两个n×n矩阵相乘所需算术运算次数的渐进幂指数，是衡量算法复杂度的核心指标。若该证明成立，意味着对于任意X＞9/4，存在算法使运算次数不超过CX·n^X；而对于任意Y＜9/4，则不存在算法能将运算次数压至CY·n^Y以内。OpenAI强调，ω作为渐进量，其理论最优性在机器学习及图像处理等领域具有重要意义，但实际应用性能仍受硬件结构、内存访问及并行计算等常数因子影响。目前，相关预印本已上传至OpenAI的GitHub math仓库，供行业研究与验证。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI修复GPT-6.2计费错误，Astra与Sol模型额度消耗分别增加40%与25%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dd755b64da7d8ada7c3fbf028ebda74.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI于11月27日紧急修复了GPT-6.2模型上线初期的计费错误。此前，用户在使用Astra和Sol模型时，套餐额度被错误地按折扣价计算。修复后，完成相同工作量所需的额度增加，导致Astra用户触及上限的速度加快40%，Sol用户加快25%。OpenAI Codex与ChatGPT负责人Thibault Sottiaux强调，尽管消耗增加，但这两款模型相比上一代仍具备更高的额度使用效率。此次错误未波及其他模型，且OpenAI不追溯此前少计的差额。作为补偿，Go、Plus、Pro及Business套餐用户将获得一次额度重置机会，Business用户在12月31日前可免费使用Fast Mode。此外，OpenAI正小范围测试Chat与Work模式的合并体验，旨在优化智能体执行多步骤任务的交互流程。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
